{
  "Scenes.Alice.AliceArouse.ArcaneArousalWarmth": "With a series of arcane gestures, her hands begin to glow faintly. Your knees quiver as a warmth builds in your nethers."
  "Scenes.Alice.AliceIllusion.ChargeForwardMelee": "You charge forward with your [weapon] to catch her, "
  "Scenes.Alice.AliceIllusion.FireShotInterrupt": "You fire a shot, hoping to interrupt her, "
  "Scenes.Alice.AliceIllusion.IllusionSpeedGain": "yet she seems to move so much faster suddenly. Or perhaps you're slower?\n"
  "Scenes.Alice.AliceIllusion.IllusionSpeedMore": "The Alice seems to gain even more speed than before!"
  "Scenes.Alice.AliceIllusion.JellySlowResisted": "You feel momentarily like you're moving through jelly, but you wince your eyes and resist whatever illusory spell she's chanted."
  "Scenes.Alice.AliceIllusion.MutterDistanceSpell": "The Alice attempts to maintain a distance while seeming to mutter something under her breath.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Alice.AliceTeases.BeggingFrightTease": "The Alice tosses her hands up onto her head in fear, shouting [say: P-please don't hurt me! I'm only a little girl, b-but I swear I can make you feel good if you won't hurt me.] She stares up at you with puppy-eyes."
  "Scenes.Alice.AliceTeases.SkirtLiftTease": "The Alice shyly looks away and she pulls the skirt of her dress up, revealing her tights-clothed thighs and white panties."
  "Scenes.Alice.AliceTeases.TailFlickPanties": "As the Alice dashes away from you, her tail flicks upwards, showing her cute little panties."
  "Scenes.Alice.AliceTeases.TripButtReveal": "Seeming to trip, the Alice falls over while trying to keep away from you. She lands flat on her face, with her perfect heart-shaped butt up and directed right at you. The appealing scene distracts you from taking advantage of the blunder."
  "Scenes.Alice.RunCheck.RelievedNoChase": "The Alice doesn't even try to stop you from running, and you can see a relieved look on her face when you look back after gaining some distance."
}
